ORDINANCE NO. 5\E
AN ORDINANCE AUTHORIZING THE CITY OFRECTOR' ARKANSAS, TO TRANSACT AND CONDUCTBUSINESS WITH THE CLAY COUNTY DEMOCRATAND FOR OTHER PURPOSES.WHEREAS, it is necessary for the City Council of the City of Rector, Arkansas,to transact or conduct business with a newspaper and,lor publishing company which ispublished or circulated in Clay County, Arkansas, which has a bona fide circulation insaid County; andWHEREAS, the Clay County Democrat offers said services to the citizens of theCity of Rector, Arkansas.THEREFORE, BE IT ORDAINED BY THE CITY COUNCIL OF THECITY OF RECTOR, ARKANSAS, AS FOLLOWS:SECTION 1.: It is determined by the City Council of the City of Rector,Arkansas to acquire the above described services with the Clay County Democrat.
